<!--ID=B7267351-473F-409D-9765-754A8EBCDE05;Version=1|{"VoiceNameToIdMapItems":[{"Id":"f1b99834-fbfc-4d32-846d-c4dbd3050c19","Name":"Microsoft Server Speech Text to Speech Voice (en-GB, OllieMultilingualNeural)","ShortName":"en-GB-OllieMultilingualNeural","Locale":"en-GB","VoiceType":"StandardVoice"}]}-->
<!--ID=FCB40C2B-1F9F-4C26-B1A1-CF8E67BE07D1;Version=1|{"Files":{}}-->
<!--ID=5B95B1CC-2C7B-494F-B746-CF22A0E779B7;Version=1|{"Locales":{"en-US":{"AutoApplyCustomLexiconFiles":[{}]},"en-GB":{"AutoApplyCustomLexiconFiles":[{}]}}}-->
<speak xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis"
       xmlns:mstts="http://www.w3.org/2001/mstts"
       xmlns:emo="http://www.w3.org/2009/10/emotionml"
       version="1.0"
       xml:lang="en-GB">
  <voice name="en-GB-OllieMultilingualNeural">
    <prosody rate="-10.00%" pitch="-2.00%">
      Take a slow breath in.<break time="500ms"/>
      And let it out gently.<break time="1000ms"/>
      Again, breathe in.<break time="500ms"/>
      And breathe out.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Let your shoulders settle.<break time="500ms"/>
      Let the weight of the day begin to lift.<break time="500ms"/>
      There is nowhere you need to be but here.<break time="1000ms"/>
      There is nothing you need to carry tonight.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Tonight we will listen to a story from the book of Joshua.<break time="500ms"/>
      The crossing of the Jordan.<break time="1000ms"/>
      A river at flood stage, a step of faith, and dry ground where water once flowed.<break time="1800ms"/>

      This is a story about standing at the edge of something wide and uncertain.<break time="500ms"/>
      About stepping forward before you can see the way through.<break time="1000ms"/>
      And about a God who parts the waters for those who trust Him enough to move.<break time="1800ms"/>

      The river was real.<break time="500ms"/>
      The flood was real.<break time="500ms"/>
      And the dry ground that appeared was real too.<break time="1800ms"/>

      So let the story come to you gently.<break time="500ms"/>
      You do not need to solve anything tonight.<break time="500ms"/>
      You only need to listen.<break time="1000ms"/>
      One calm sentence at a time.<break time="1800ms"/>

      Tonight, remember this as we begin.<break time="500ms"/>
      The river is crossed.<break time="500ms"/>
      The ground is dry.<break time="500ms"/>
      You are carried.<break time="1800ms"/>
    </prosody>
  </voice>
</speak>
